  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 528ecde27feefd74eb359b784c14f552, type: 3}
  m_Name: Vivian
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DollConfig
  dollName: Vivian
  dollOwner: Vivian Marks, 6 y.o., female, alive
  dollStory: Vivian, the doll named after its owner, was found beside the lifeless
    body of Vivian's mother. The mother had been brutally strangled, allegedly thrown
    around and beaten before ultimately choking to death. Vivian, the child, was
    questioned about the incident but was asleep during the commotion, as it occurred
    in the dead of night. The doll, which Vivian typically left in the living room,
    was discovered right next to the mother's body. Vivian, traumatized, has been
    placed to the care of her father.
  dollReason: Vivian harbors a malicious spirit. Vivian attacked her owner's mother
    in the middle of the night, while everyone was sleeping. The mother, being the
    only one to see the doll move, couldn't tell anyone about it. The doll proceeded
    to strangle the mother until she died from lack of oxygen. The doll is to be
    destroyed immediately, as it has already caused the death of a human being.
